WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.840
My name is Jordan Hart, and I'm from Essex.

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:06.000
So it broke us for me to have a really big weight loss journey.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.400
I've lost almost 17 stone myself in two and a half years

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.920
with the aid of everyone here at Blueprint.

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:15.360
That is the consistency of coming three to four times a week

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:18.440
to small group, but also other services that I offer.

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:21.600
So Metcon classes, sweat classes, boxing classes.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:24.240
I've just been in a real community gym

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:27.480
where I feel ultra, ultra comfortable to come here.

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:29.400
It's not a scary, pasty car.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:32.560
It's coaches and people here that become friends.

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:34.920
And it's not only the gym setting,

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:36.280
it's also the white setting.

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:40.600
So, you know, going out as a group outside the gym,

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:43.280
going to the golf together, whatever it may be,

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:45.400
it just makes you feel really welcome.

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:48.280
And that old evening gives you the confidence to come.

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:50.240
You're never in fear of,

00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:51.560
oh my gosh, I need to go to the gym,

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:54.720
but I don't know the person, or I'm afraid,

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:57.160
whatever it be, because it can be quite a scary setting.

00:00:57.160 --> 00:00:59.360
And this is complete, complete of set up.

